      "writtenOn": "2026-07-31T08:40:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The type field is the other half of this. get_region matches on start alone, so during the deprivilege window, before each redistributor\u0027s own init has run, __pkvm_init_its_emulation with a redistributor\u0027s base returns that region and installs an its_priv_state in it. Its cb was set at registration and stays pkvm_handle_rdist_emulation, so the redist handlers would then read lpi_enabled, propbaser and pendbaser out of an its_priv_state.\n\nCould get_region take the expected type, or the callers check it?",
      "revId": "c7a78521b326ad9181dfa6137daae9734f62898c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
